# Monochrome Design System Guidelines (v1.1 Geist Standard)

All visual elements in `threadsos.dev` MUST strictly follow the Monochrome High-Contrast aesthetic outlined in `docs/2026-07-29/ui-ux-design-spec.md`.

## 1. Color System (Strict Monochrome — No Accent Colors)

### Dark Mode Palette (Default)
- Nền ngoài cùng (`--p-background`): `#0C0C0C`
- Surface container (`--p-surface-container`): `#1F1F1F`
- Input / Hover state (`--p-surface-container-high`): `#262626`
- Viền mờ mặc định (`--p-outline-variant`): `#3D3839`
- Text chính (`--p-on-background`): `#F2F2F2` (Trắng kem)
- Nút Primary Action (`--p-primary`): `#F5F5F5` (Nền Trắng, chữ Đen `#0C0C0C`)

### Light Mode Palette
- Nền ngoài cùng (`--p-background`): `#F9F9F9`
- Viền (`--p-outline-variant`): `#CFC4C5`
- Text chính (`--p-on-background`): `#1A1C1C`
- Nút Primary Action (`--p-primary`): `#000000` (Nền Đen, chữ Trắng `#FFFFFF`)

### STRICT NO-NOS:
- ❌ NO gradients (especially purple/violet/cyan AI gradients).
- ❌ NO generic colors (red/blue/green accents for primary UI buttons).
- ❌ NO soft rounded pill designs everywhere — keep borders sharp (`radius-sm: 4px`, `radius-md: 6px`).

## 2. Typography
- **Primary Font:** `Geist Sans` (`font-sans`) for all headlines, body text, buttons.
- **Monospace Font:** `JetBrains Mono` (`font-mono`) for labels, badges, character counts, framework tags, and output previews.

## 3. Core UI Components

### Primary Button
- High-contrast solid background (`#F5F5F5` in Dark Mode, `#000000` in Light Mode).
- SemiBold 14px text.
- Micro-interaction: Hover translates `-2px, -2px` with a crisp hard shadow `box-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--p-primary)`. Active translates back `0, 0`.

### Threads Preview Card
- Must closely mimic the native Threads app layout:
  - User avatar monogram/circle
  - Username & timestamp in Mono/Sans
  - Clean formatted thread body preserving linebreaks
  - Bottom action bar: Heart, Reply, Repost, Share icons (thin outline icons).

### Micro-interactions & Toast Notifications
- Copy action feedback: Toast notification `[✓ Đã sao chép bài viết vào Clipboard]` in crisp monochrome black/white.
